    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abram went up out of Egypt, he, and his wife, and all that he had, and Lot with him, into the south.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abram",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "very rich in cattle, in silver, and in gold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he went on his journeys from the south even to Beth-el, unto the place where his tent had been at the beginning, between Beth-el and Hai;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unto the place of the altar, which he had made there at the first: and there Abram called on the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And Lot also, which went with Abram, had flocks, and herds, and tents.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the land was not able to bear them, that they might dwell together: for their substance was great, so that they could not dwell together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there was a strife between the herdmen of Abram's cattle and the herdmen of Lot's cattle: and the Canaanite and the Perizzite dwelled then in the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abram said unto Lot, Let there be no strife, I pray thee, between me and thee, and between my herdmen and thy herdmen; for we",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brethren.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not the whole land before thee? separate thyself, I pray thee, from me: if",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thou wilt take",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the left hand, then I will go to the right; or if",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thou depart",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the right hand, then I will go to the left.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
