          "text": "And Lot lifted up his eyes, and beheld all the plain of Jordan, that it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "well watered every where, before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "destroyed Sodom and Gomorrah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as the garden of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", like the land of Egypt, as thou comest unto Zoar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Lot chose him all the plain of Jordan; and Lot journeyed east: and they separated themselves the one from the other.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abram dwelled in the land of Canaan, and Lot dwelled in the cities of the plain, and pitched",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tent toward Sodom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the men of Sodom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wicked and sinners before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "exceedingly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
