              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto Abram, after that Lot was separated from him, Lift up now thine eyes, and look from the place where thou art northward, and southward, and eastward, and westward:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For all the land which thou seest, to thee will I give it, and to thy seed for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will make thy seed as the dust of the earth: so that if a man can number the dust of the earth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "then",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall thy seed also be numbered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arise, walk through the land in the length of it and in the breadth of it; for I will give it unto thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Abram removed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tent, and came and dwelt in the plain of Mamre, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
